  <summary>Protect the sheep on each level</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Gordon needs to protect the sheep so that he can go on to the end of each level
    </p>
    <p>
      Use your water gun to kill enemies, the action handler to open the gate, and enable the elevator to help the sheep to pass
    </p>
    <p>
      Play alone or with a friend on the same screen in 2 players co-op mode:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>One keyboard, a keyboard and a gamepad, or two gamepads</li>
      <li>Every key and button can be changed and tried in a test area before the game starts</li>
      <li>Each player has their own life bar</li>
      <li>Gates and elevators only move once both players pull the handle</li>
      <li>A fallen player is back at the next level</li>
      <li>Two motorbikes on two roads in the bonus level</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This game was made with Godot 4.7
    </p>
  </description>
